@startuml
title Implemented persistent ReductionTrace

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #374151
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #1F2937
  FontColor #111827
}

rectangle "Arc<[Par]> root\n[input, saturated initial]" as Root #DBEAFE
rectangle "TraceLink 1\nrendezvous r1\nconfiguration S1" as L1 #EDE9FE
rectangle "TraceLink 2a\nrendezvous r2\nconfiguration S2a" as L2A #DCFCE7
rectangle "TraceLink 2b\nrendezvous r3\nconfiguration S2b" as L2B #FEF3C7

L1 --> Root : parent / shared root
L2A --> L1 : parent
L2B --> L1 : parent

rectangle "MATERIALIZE leaf 2a\nfixed output array\nfill from tail toward root" as Mat #D1FAE5
rectangle "DROP leaf 2b\ntry_unwrap unique suffix\nstop at shared L1" as Drop #FCE7F3

L2A --> Mat
L2B --> Drop

note right of L2B #F9FAFB
  EXTEND is one Arc allocation and
  one parent reference, independent
  of trace depth.
end note

note bottom of Mat #F9FAFB
  Materialization is linear in the
  delivered path length and consumes
  constant native stack.
end note
@enduml
